# User-owned paths: on `pnpm midas:update`, merge conflicts here always keep
# the LOCAL version (merge driver "midas-user" is configured by the update
# script as `git config merge.midas-user.driver true`). Upstream never needs
# to win in these files — they hold the operator's own research and strategies.
research/hypotheses/queue.md merge=midas-user
research/hypotheses/ledger.md merge=midas-user
research/knowledge/** merge=midas-user
research/reports/** merge=midas-user
research/scripts/** merge=midas-user
src/strategies/index.ts merge=midas-user
